# Nested Minecraft server state stays private, including under test resources.
**/server.properties
**/eula.txt
**/usercache.json
**/ops.json
**/whitelist.json
**/banned-players.json
**/banned-ips.json

# PlugDev state stays private even below test fixture roots.
**/.plugdev/

# Nested private credentials and disposable test datasets
**/.secrets/
**/test-data/

# Local SQL export names only; schema, migration, and fixture SQL remain eligible for tracking.
*dump*.sql
*backup*.sql
!**/*schema*.sql
!**/migration/**/*.sql
!**/migrations/**/*.sql
!**/fixture/**/*.sql
!**/fixtures/**/*.sql

# Re-exclude local runtime data after broad test-fixture allow rules above.
**/.plugdev/
**/test-server*/
**/server-test*/
# World data under nested server roots
**/server/world*/
**/servers/**/world*/
# Generic local dumps and backups; no tracked fixtures currently use these suffixes
*.dump
*.bak
